ded game:** calling `guess` after the game is over raises `ValueError(\"The game has already ended.\")`.\n- **Masked word:** `get_masked_word` shows guessed letters and `_` for the rest.\n- **Status:** `get_status` returns the current status.\n\nThe \"lose on the 10th wrong guess\" rule is my reading of the exercise, since the stub starts with 9 guesses. If the tests expect the game to end at 0 remaining guesses, change the lose check to `<= 0`.","ttft_ms":1697,"type":"result","duration_ms":9520,"uuid":"423d08c9-979d-4bc4-92a2-75556483bd28","ttft_stream_ms":1088,"time_to_request_ms":203,"first_content_frame_ms":1089,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

